zvec-grep/supported-content#images","content":"Images are skipped by default. To index GIF, JPEG, PNG, or WebP files, include them explicitly and select an Embedding model that accepts images.","locale":"en"},"660":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-27","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#content-currently-skipped","content":"PDF and Office files, archives, compiled artifacts, audio, video, database files, empty files, binaries detected by extension or content sampling, and files above the configured size limit are not indexed.","locale":"en"},"661":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content-28","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/supported-content#content-currently-skipped","content":"Use `zg index --debug` to inspect skipped-file counts and samples. Scope discovery with `--glob`, file types, ignore files, depth, and maximum file size.","locale":"en"},"662":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec-Grep","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","locale":"en"},"663":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnose installation, indexing, search, local-service, Agent connection, and remote-embedding problems.","locale":"en"},"664":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-zg-command-is-unavailable","content":"The `zg` Command Is Unavailable","locale":"en"},"665":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooti