s-unavailable","content":"If npm succeeds but `zg` is still missing, add npm's global binary directory to your shell `PATH`.","locale":"en"},"674":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Run commands from the intended workspace root:","locale":"en"},"675":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#the-index-is-missing-or-stale","content":"Use `--rebuild` only when changing the embedding model or intentionally replacing stored index settings.","locale":"en"},"676":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--rg` for known text, identifiers, paths, or regex.","locale":"en"},"677":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use `--fts` for known terms that need ranking.","locale":"en"},"678":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Use the default hybrid query when wording or location is unknown.","locale":"en"},"679":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Restrict broad workspaces with `-g`, `-t`, or `-T`.","locale":"en"},"680":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"Confirm that the content is indexed and the model fits it.","locale":"en"},"681":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#search-results-are-empty-or-weak","content":"See Search Guide, Supported Content, and Embedding Models.","locale":"en"},"682":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"This applies only when using `--mode server` or an HTTP MCP connection. Default stdio Agent integrations manage the service automatically.","locale":"en"},"683":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#explicit-server-mode-is-not-ready","content":"Run `zg server run` when you need foreground logs. See Local Server for lifecycle, client mode, listen address, and authentication.","locale":"en"},"684":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"Restart the Agent or open a new session. Exact identifiers and filenames may correctly use its native grep instead of Zvec-Grep. See Connect AI Agents.","locale":"en"},"685":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Inspect or grant the separate workspace authorization:","locale":"en"},"686":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Use `--allow-remote` for one command, or choose a local model when content must not leave the machine.","locale":"en"},"687":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"`--drop` deletes the workspace index, not the source files. Indexed search remains unavailable until you build another index.","locale":"en"},"688":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"When reporting a problem, include the version, operating system, failing command, relevant `zg status`, and sanitized diagnostics. Remove credentials, private paths, and sensitive excerpts.","locale":"en"},"689":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"Open a Zvec-Grep issue","locale":"en"},"690":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP Server","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","For Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","locale":"en"},"691":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#quick-setup","content":"Quick Setup","locale":"en"},"692":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-1","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#qoder-recommended","content":"Qoder (Recommended)","locale":"en"},"693":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp#claude-code","content":"Claude Code","locale":"en"},"694":{"id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db/agents/mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/agents/m