docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid#performing-filtered-vector-search","content":"To combine vector similarity search with filters, pass both a query specification and a `filter` expression to the `query()` method.","locale":"en"},"2375":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid-8","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query/hybrid#performing-filtered-vector-search","content":"This returns the top-10 most similar documents that satisfy `publish_year > 1936`, sorted by similarity score.","locale":"en"},"2376":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"page","content":"Query","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","Guides","Data Operations","Query"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","locale":"en"},"2377":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query#query","content":"`Query`","locale":"en"},"2378":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query-1","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query#query-types","content":"Query Types","locale":"en"},"2379":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query#quick-start-examples","content":"Quick Start Examples","locale":"en"},"2380":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query#single-vector-search","content":"Single-Vector Search","locale":"en"},"2381":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query-4","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/query#multi-vect