enchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"Zvec-Grep 的评测对象是完整的 Agent 任务，而不只是孤立的检索延迟。它关注的是：更好的检索能否让 Agent 在保持回答质量的同时，使用更少上下文、更少工具调用和更短时间完成任务。","locale":"zh"},"2848":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","content":"每个样例都使用相同的任务、Agent、模型、Prompt、环境和资源限制。实验组只增加预先构建的 Zvec-Grep 索引、工具和通用使用说明。索引准备耗时与 Agent 执行耗时分开统计。","locale":"zh"},"2849":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"工作负载","locale":"zh"},"2850":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"回答质量","locale":"zh"},"2851":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"输入 Token","locale":"zh"},"2852":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh"},"2853":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"Agent 耗时","locale":"zh"},"2854":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"代码理解 · SWE-QA-Bench","locale":"zh"},"2855":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**+1.50 pp**","locale":"zh"},"2856":{"id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/zvec-grep/benchmarks#结果概览","content":"**−47.