cs/db/collections/schema-evolution-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **添加或删除标量字段**","locale":"zh"},"3442":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **重命名字段**或**更改数据类型**（需确保变更安全，如从 `INT32` 到 `INT64`）","locale":"zh"},"3443":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **创建或删除字段索引**","locale":"zh"},"3444":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"❌  添加或删除向量字段（🔜 即将支持）","locale":"zh"},"3445":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"在 Zvec 中，Schema 变更通过\\*\\*数据定义语言（DDL）\\*\\*方法执行，分为两类：","locale":"zh"},"3446":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Column DDL**：定义*你存储什么数据*。\n管理 Collection 的结构，包括添加、删除、重命名或修改字段。","locale":"zh"},"3447":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Index DDL**：定义*你如何搜索数据*。\n控制字段上索引的创建和删除。","locale":"zh"},"3448":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"💡 **Zvec 索引规则**","locale":"zh"},"3449":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**每个向量字段都必须建索引**，使用合适的向量索引以支持相似度搜索。","locale":"zh"},"3450":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**标量字段索引是可选的**——但你应该为计划在过滤查询中使用的标量字段建立倒排索引（如 `WHERE category = 'music'`）。","locale":"zh"},"3451":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"本指南假设你已打开一个 Collection 并准备好了 `collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"3452":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"该示例 Collection 包含一个标量字段 `publish_year`。","locale":"zh"},"3453":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"使用 `add_column()` 向已有 Collection 添加新的标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3454":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`field_schema`：\n定义新字段的名称和数据类型。详见标量字段 Schema。","locale":"zh"},"3455":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`expression`：\n为已有 Document 指定默认值。由于已有 Document 没有 `rating` 字段，Zvec 使用此 `expression` 填充缺失值——本例中将所有现有 Document 的 `rating` 设为 5。","locale":"zh"},"3456":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"目前仅支持通过 `add_column()` 添加**数值型标量字段**。对 `string` 和 `boolean` 类型的支持即将推出。\n因此，`expression` 必须求值为数字——可以是单个数字字面量（如 `\"5\"`）或涉及已有数值字段的简单算术表达式（如 `\"publish_year + 1\"`）。","locale":"zh"},"3457":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"使用 `drop_column()` 永久删除标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3458":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"此操作会**从 Collection 中每个 Document 删除该字段及其所有数据**。该操作**不可逆**。","locale":"zh"},"3459":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#修改列","content":"使用 `alter_column()` 重命名列或更新其 Schema：","locale":"zh"},"3460":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"修改完成后，你可以随时打印 Schema 来查看 Collection 的当前结构：","locale":"zh"},"3461":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"详见 Schema 示例。","locale":"zh"},"3462":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"你可以使用 `create_index()` 在**向量**和**标量**字段上创建（或替换）索引以加速搜索：","locale":"zh"},"3463":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"**向量字段**必须使用以下索引类型之一：","locale":"zh"},"3464":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`HnswIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3465":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`HnswRabitqIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3466":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`IVFIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3467":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"`FlatIndexParam`","locale":"zh"},"3468":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"**标量字段**使用 `InvertIndexParam` 以启用高效过滤。","locale":"zh"},"3469":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"使用 `drop_index()` 删除标量字段上的索引：","locale":"zh"},"3470":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"**不允许删除向量字段的索引**。\n在 Zvec 中，每个向量字段必须始终有且仅有一个索引以支持相似度搜索。","locale":"zh"},"3471":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"page","content":"数据结构","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","locale":"zh"},"3472":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","content":"Zvec 如何通过 collection、document、schema 和索引来组织数据。","locale":"zh"},"3473":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"Collections","locale":"zh"},"3474":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"为什么要使用 Collection？","locale":"zh"},"3475":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"持久化","locale":"zh"},"3476":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#documents","content":"Documents","locale":"zh"},"3477":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"Document 的结构","locale":"zh"},"3478":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"Document 示例","locale":"zh"},"3479":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"数据类型","locale":"zh"},"3480":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"标量类型","locale":"zh"},"3481":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"向量类型","locale":"zh"},"3482":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"索引","locale":"zh"},"3483":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","content":"Zvec 采用 **Collection** 和 **Document** 的结构来组织数据。","locale":"zh"},"3484":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**Collection** 是用来存放 documents 的具名容器 — 类似于关系型数据库 (如 MySQL) 中的**数据表**，其中每个 **document** 对应表中的**一行**。Collection 用于存储、组织和查询数据。","locale":"zh"},"3485":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"每个 Collection 由一个 **Schema** 定义，Schema 描述了其包含的标量字段和向量及其类型和索引设置。","locale":"zh"},"3486":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**同一个 collection 中的所有 documents 都必须遵循相同的 schema**。","locale":"zh"},"3487":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"Zvec 中的 collection schema 是**动态的**：你可以随时添加或删除标量字段和向量，无需重建 collection。","locale":"zh"},"3488":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#collections","content":"**不支持跨 collection 查询**：不支持 Join、Union 或多 collection 检索。请据此合理设计你的数据模型。","locale":"zh"},"3489":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"Collection 提供了**隔离**，确保每个业务场景都拥有独立的 schema 和索引配置。这种隔离既避免了不同业务之间的相互干扰，也让它们可以独立调整。","locale":"zh"},"3490":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"例如：","locale":"zh"},"3491":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**检索增强生成（RAG）collection** 可能存储文本向量以及元数据 — 如标题、章节、源 URL 和最后更新时间戳。","locale":"zh"},"3492":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#为什么要使用-collection","content":"**图片搜索 collection** 可以存储高维度的图片向量以及相关字段，如图片 ID、文件路径或描述。","locale":"zh"},"3493":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"**每个 collection 独立持久化在磁盘上的专属目录中**，从而在不同的业务场景之间提供隔离。","locale":"zh"},"3494":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#持久化","content":"每个 collection **完全自包含于其目录中**。这意味着你可以自由迁移 collection 的文件夹，只需提供正确的路径，Zvec 就能顺利加载它。","locale":"zh"},"3495":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#documents","content":"Document 是数据存储的基本单元 — 类似于关系型数据库表中的一条记录或一行。每个 document 都存在于一个 collection 中，并且必须符合该 collection 的 schema。","locale":"zh"},"3496":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"Document 是由三个核心部分组成的**结构化**对象。","locale":"zh"},"3497":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🔑 `id`：Document 的唯一字符串标识符，在 document 被写入后不可修改","locale":"zh"},"3498":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"📐 `vectors`：一组具名向量","locale":"zh"},"3499":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-的结构","content":"🗂️ `fields`：一组具名标量 (非向量) 字段，可包含字符串、数值、布尔值或这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"3500":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"这个 document 属于一个定义了如下 schema 的 collection：","locale":"zh"},"3501":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"两个稠密向量：`vector_1`（4 维）和 `vector_2`（6 维）","locale":"zh"},"3502":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"一个稀疏向量：`vector_3`","locale":"zh"},"3503":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"标量字段：`category`（字符串）、`price`（整数）和 `languages`（字符串数组）","locale":"zh"},"3504":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"**所有字段必须符合 schema 中声明的类型**。向量必须匹配指定的类型(稠密或稀疏)和维度(例如，768维的向量字段不能接受512维的向量)。","locale":"zh"},"3505":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#document-示例","content":"Document 插入后，可以通过 `upsert()` 或局部 `update()` 操作进行更新，但所有修改仍必须遵守 collection schema 约束。","locale":"zh"},"3506":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"Zvec 实现了强类型的 schema 系统，并使用 `DataType` 枚举，其支持的类型可分为以下两类:","locale":"zh"},"3507":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**标量类型** — 字符串、整数、浮点数、布尔值以及这些类型的数组","locale":"zh"},"3508":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**向量类型** — 稠密向量和稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"3509":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#数据类型","content":"**数据写入阶段会执行类型安全检查**：Document 内的每个字段都必须严格符合其声明的 `DataType`。","locale":"zh"},"3510":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"基础类型","locale":"zh"},"3511":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`STRING`","locale":"zh"},"3512":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`BOOL`","locale":"zh"},"3513":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT32`","locale":"zh"},"3514":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`INT64`","locale":"zh"},"3515":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`UINT32`","locale":"zh"},"3516":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`UINT64`","locale":"zh"},"3517":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`FLOAT`","locale":"zh"},"3518":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`DOUBLE`","locale":"zh"},"3519":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"数组类型","locale":"zh"},"3520":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_STRING`","locale":"zh"},"3521":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_BOOL`","locale":"zh"},"3522":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_INT32`","locale":"zh"},"3523":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_INT64`","locale":"zh"},"3524":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_UINT32`","locale":"zh"},"3525":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_UINT64`","locale":"zh"},"3526":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_FLOAT`","locale":"zh"},"3527":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"`ARRAY_DOUBLE`","locale":"zh"},"3528":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#标量类型","content":"数组不支持混合类型或嵌套结构，所有元素均须严格匹配声明的元素类型。","locale":"zh"},"3529":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"稠密向量：以固定长度的数值数组表示，例如 `[0.1, -0.5, ..., 0.9]`","locale":"zh"},"3530":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_FP16`","locale":"zh"},"3531":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_FP32`","locale":"zh"},"3532":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`VECTOR_INT8`","locale":"zh"},"3533":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"稀疏向量：以整数索引到浮点值的映射表示，例如 `{ 42: 0.85, 1024: 0.13 }`","locale":"zh"},"3534":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP32`","locale":"zh"},"3535":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#向量类型","content":"`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP16`","locale":"zh"},"3536":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"除了基础的数据存储外，索引是实现高效数据检索的关键。在 Zvec 中：","locale":"zh"},"3537":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"**向量字段：必须为其配置相应的向量索引**，以支持相似度检索。","locale":"zh"},"3538":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"**标量字段：支持可选索引** — 若标量字段将用于过滤查询(如 `WHERE category = 'music'`)，则强烈建议为其建立倒排索引。","locale":"zh"},"3539":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/data-modeling#索引","content":"你可以在创建 collection 时，通过在 schema 中为每