_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[3]`","locale":"zh"},"3734":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Chinese","locale":"zh"},"3735":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[6]`","locale":"zh"},"3736":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"**倒排索引：`author`**","locale":"zh"},"3737":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Author","locale":"zh"},"3738":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Doc IDs","locale":"zh"},"3739":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Julia Chen","locale":"zh"},"3740":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[1, 6]`","locale":"zh"},"3741":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Liam Tran","locale":"zh"},"3742":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[2]`","locale":"zh"},"3743":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Elena Gomez","locale":"zh"},"3744":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[3]`","locale":"zh"},"3745":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"Marco Rossi","locale":"zh"},"3746":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"`[4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"3747":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"有了这些索引，查询变得极其高效 ✨：","locale":"zh"},"3748":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查找所有意大利菜谱\" → 在 `cuisine` 索引中查找 \"Italian\" → `[1, 4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"3749":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查看 Marco Rossi 的菜谱\" → 在 `author` 索引中查找 \"Marco Rossi\" → `[4, 5]`","locale":"zh"},"3750":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"\"查找 Julia Chen 的意大利菜谱\" → 取交集 `[1, 4, 5]` 和 `[1, 6]` → `[1]`","locale":"zh"},"3751":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#工作原理","content":"我们**不对 `url` 建立索引**，因为它很少用于查询。对其建立索引会浪费存储空间并减慢写入速度，而收益甚微。一旦我们有了 Document ID，可以直接从原始数据中获取其 `url`。","locale":"zh"},"3752":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"因为它将标准映射进行了反转：","locale":"zh"},"3753":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-81","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"方向","locale":"zh"},"3754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-82","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"映射","locale":"zh"},"3755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-83","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"正向","locale":"zh"},"3756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-84","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"Document ID → 词项列表","locale":"zh"},"3757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-85","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"倒排","locale":"zh"},"3758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-86","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"词项 → Document ID 列表","locale":"zh"},"3759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-87","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#为什么叫倒排","content":"这种反转使得基于关键词的搜索变得高效。无需检查每个 Document 是否包含查询词项，而是直接跳转到该词项并立即获取所有匹配的 Document。","locale":"zh"},"3760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-88","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"虽然倒排索引功能强大，但也有一定代价：","locale":"zh"},"3761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-89","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **存储开销**：索引需要额外的存储空间。","locale":"zh"},"3762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index-90","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/inverted-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作 — `INSERT`、`UPSERT` 和 `UPDATE` — 都需要维护索引，增加了写入延迟和 I/O 负载。","locale":"zh"},"3763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"page","content":"向量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","locale":"zh"},"3764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","content":"非结构化数据的数值表示，用于捕捉语义信息以支持相似度检索。","locale":"zh"},"3765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"什么是向量？","locale":"zh"},"3766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"如何在数据库中使用向量？","locale":"zh"},"3767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"向量如何赋能应用？","locale":"zh"},"3768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"什么是 Embedding 模型？","locale":"zh"},"3769":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量类型","content":"向量类型","locale":"zh"},"3770":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"稠密向量","locale":"zh"},"3771":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"3772":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"在人工智能与向量数据库的语境下，&#x2A;**向量是由 embedding 模型生成的一组数字，用于捕捉非结构化数据的语义信息*** — 例如文本、图片或音频。","locale":"zh"},"3773":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是向量","content":"这些模型将原始输入映射到一个高维空间中，&#x2A;**使得语义相似的内容能够生成相近的向量***，从而让 AI 系统能够基于含义进行比较，而不再局限于关键词匹配。","locale":"zh"},"3774":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"🗂️ **存储**：用 embedding 模型将数据 (如文档、商品图片或用户画像) 转化为向量，并存入向量数据库。","locale":"zh"},"3775":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"🔍 **搜索**：当收到新的查询请求时 (例如一段文本或一张图片)，用相同的 embedding 模型将其转化为**查询向量**，随后使用数据库检索并返回与之最相似的向量。","locale":"zh"},"3776":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#如何在数据库中使用向量","content":"借助高效的索引机制，即使在大规模数据场景下，数据库也能迅速返回相关结果。这正是语义搜索的核心：**寻找含义相同的内容，而非仅仅是文字相同的内容**。","locale":"zh"},"3777":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"**图像搜索**就是一个绝佳的例子：","locale":"zh"},"3778":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"每张图像都会被转化为一个向量，用来捕捉其形状、色彩和物体类别等视觉特征。","locale":"zh"},"3779":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"**视觉或语义上相似的图像会生成相近的向量**。","locale":"zh"},"3780":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"通过比较这些向量，搜索系统能够：","locale":"zh"},"3781":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"✅ **在不同照片中识别同一个人**：即使光照、姿势或表情发生变化，同一个人的照片也会生成相似的向量，这让系统能够可靠地匹配身份。","locale":"zh"},"3782":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"✅ **在电商平台中查找相似商品**：当用户拍摄一件裙子、灯具或沙发的照片时，系统会将其向量与商品库中的向量进行比对，并检索出外观或风格相似的商品。","locale":"zh"},"3783":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量如何赋能应用","content":"这一切都得益于向量数据库提供的高效的向量相似度检索功能。","locale":"zh"},"3784":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"Embedding 模型是一种将原始数据转化为向量的 AI 模型 — 正如顶部示意图所示。","locale":"zh"},"3785":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"这些模型通过海量训练数据学习内在规律，确保语义相似的对象在向量空间中生成的向量彼此邻近 — 通常使用**余弦相似度**、**点积**或**欧氏距离**等距离度量来衡量。","locale":"zh"},"3786":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"**距离度量的选择至关重要。** 如果 embedding 模型是基于特定度量标准 (如余弦相似度) 训练的，那么在向量数据库中进行搜索时，也必须使用相同的度量标准，才能保证语义关系的准确性，从而获得最优的搜索结果。","locale":"zh"},"3787":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#什么是-embedding-模型","content":"若要探索和比较最新的 embedding 模型，你可以查看 Hugging Face 的 Embedding 排行榜，该榜单评估了数百种模型在不同任务和语言环境下的表现。","locale":"zh"},"3788":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#向量类型","content":"向量主要分为两类：**稠密向量**和**稀疏向量**，它们各自以独特的方式捕捉数据特征。","locale":"zh"},"3789":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"稠密向量是固定长度的实值数组，其(几乎)每一个维度都承载着语义信息。这类向量通常由深度学习模型生成，这些模型将文本、图像、音频等原始输入转化为结构化的向量空间，从而反映出它们在语义上的相似性。","locale":"zh"},"3790":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"**✅ 语义丰富**：能够理解上下文和深层含义 (例如，\"国王 – 男人 + 女人 ≈ 皇后\")","locale":"zh"},"3791":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稠密向量","content":"**⚠️ 不可解释**：难以直观判断究竟是哪些特征导致了相似性","locale":"zh"},"3792":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"稀疏向量通常是极高维的 (维度大小往往等同于词汇表大小)，但其中只有极少部分维度是非零值。每一个被激活的维度都对应一个特定的词项 (如单词或 n-gram)，并带有如 **BM25** 之类的相关性权重。","locale":"zh"},"3793":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"在这种模型下，每篇文档都会被转化为一个向量 — 称为文档向量 — 用于记录其中出现了哪些词项以及它们的重要性。同样地，搜索查询也会使用相同的加权方案转化为稀疏向量。","locale":"zh"},"3794":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"与精确关键词匹配不同，查询与文档之间的相似度是通过计算两者向量的点积得出的。这种方式衡量的是加权词项的匹配程度：包含了与查询相同且重要的词项的文档会获得更高的分数 — 从而同时兼顾了词项的**重叠度**和**重要性**。","locale":"zh"},"3795":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"为了计算效率，稀疏向量使用整数索引将词项映射到词表字典中的位置，而不直接存储词项字符串。","locale":"zh"},"3796":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"**✅ 可解释性强**：非零维度直接对应已知的词项 (例如，`4017` → \"puppy\")","locale":"zh"},"3797":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-embedding#稀疏向量","content":"**⚠️ 缺乏语义理解**：除非建立明确关联，否则会将 \"car\" 和 \"automobile\" 视为互不相关的词","locale":"zh"},"3798":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","type":"page","content":"删除","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","数据操作"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","locale":"zh"},"3799":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"按 ID 删除","locale":"zh"},"3800":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按筛选条件删除","content":"按筛选条件删除","locale":"zh"},"3801":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"Zvec 提供两种删除 Document 的方式。请根据场景选择合适的方法：","locale":"zh"},"3802":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"方法","locale":"zh"},"3803":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"输入","locale":"zh"},"3804":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"使用场景","locale":"zh"},"3805":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"`delete()`","locale":"zh"},"3806":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"一个或多个 Document `id`","locale":"zh"},"3807":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"已知要删除的 Document 的确切 ID 时使用","locale":"zh"},"3808":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"`delete_by_filter()`","locale":"zh"},"3809":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"过滤表达式（如 `publish_year < 1900`）","locale":"zh"},"3810":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"基于字段值批量删除——适用于清理符合特定条件的 Document","locale":"zh"},"3811":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","content":"删除操作是**即时**且**不可逆**的。\n执行删除前请务必仔细核对输入。","locale":"zh"},"3812":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"假设你已打开 Collection 并准备好 `collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"3813":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"使用 `delete()` 在已知确切 ID 时删除一个或多个 Document。","locale":"zh"},"3814":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"传入单个 `id` 时，`delete()` 返回一个 `Status` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"3815":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete#按-id-删除","content":"传入 `id` 列表时，返回相同顺序的 `Status` 对象列表。","locale":"zh"},"3816":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/delete",