ns/iterate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"选择字段与向量","locale":"zh"},"3886":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"快照语义","locale":"zh"},"3887":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#并发行为","content":"并发行为","locale":"zh"},"3888":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#提前结束遍历","content":"提前结束遍历","locale":"zh"},"3889":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","content":"使用 &#x2A;*`iter_docs()`** 逐个流式遍历 Collection 中的**所有** Document。","locale":"zh"},"3890":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","content":"与按已知 `id` 获取 Document 的 `fetch()` 不同，迭代器执行**全量扫描**。Document 以有界窗口分批流式读取，因此不会将整个 Collection 一次性载入内存，适合导出、备份、迁移或离线处理等场景。","locale":"zh"},"3891":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","content":"迭代器在 Collection 上持有一个原生资源槽位，因此交给语言自身来关闭它：Python 的 `with` 语句和 JavaScript 的 `for...of` 循环，都会在循环正常结束、提前 break 或抛出异常时释放迭代器。迭代器在被完全遍历耗尽时也会自动关闭。","locale":"zh"},"3892":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"默认情况下，每个 Document 的所有标量字段和所有向量都会被读取。可以使用 `output_fields` 和 `include_vector` 减少读取的数据量：","locale":"zh"},"3893":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"**`output_fields`**（`outputFields`）：要返回的标量字段名列表。不传时返回所有标量字段；传入空列表则不返回任何标量字段。未知或重复的字段名会报错。","locale":"zh"},"3894":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#选择字段与向量","content":"**`include_vector`**（`includeVector`）：是否读取向量数据。默认读取向量；如果只需要标量字段，将其关闭可以加快遍历速度。","locale":"zh"},"3895":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"`iter_docs()` 与 `iterDocsSync()` 遍历的都是**调用时刻创建的隔离快照**：","locale":"zh"},"3896":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"迭代器创建**之后**写入的数据（`insert`、`upsert`、`update`）对该迭代器**不可见**。","locale":"zh"},"3897":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"创建之后的删除不影响遍历；创建快照时已被删除的 Document 会被过滤掉。","locale":"zh"},"3898":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"对于可写 Collection，创建迭代器可能会封存（seal）当前写入段（每次调用都可能产生一个新的小段）；只读 Collection 则直接扫描，不写入任何数据。","locale":"zh"},"3899":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate#快照语义","content":"遍历顺序未定义——它**不是**插入顺序，且在 `optimize()` 重组段之后可能改变，因此切勿依赖它。","locale":"zh"},"3900":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iterate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/iter