bedding**：","locale":"zh"},"3926":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"`dense_embedding`：768 维稠密向量","locale":"zh"},"3927":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"`sparse_embedding`：稀疏向量","locale":"zh"},"3928":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"要更新已有 Document，提供其 `id` 以及要更改的字段或向量：","locale":"zh"},"3929":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"`update()` 方法会先验证 Document：","locale":"zh"},"3930":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"**错误用法**——如未知字段或向量维度不匹配——**会抛出错误**。","locale":"zh"},"3931":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"**如果验证通过**，方法执行更新并返回 `Status` 对象，指示成功或失败（如 `ID` 不存在）。","locale":"zh"},"3932":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#更新单个-document","content":"成功更新的 Document 立即可查询 🚀。","locale":"zh"},"3933":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/update#批量更新-document","content":"传入 `Doc` 对象列表即可一次更新多个 Document。\n每个 `Doc` 独立处理，方法返回 `Status` 对象列表——每个 Document 对应一个。","locale"