/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"<Card icon=\"<TableOfContents className=&#x22;text-fd-primary&#x22; />\" title=\"Schema\" href=\"./schema/\" />","locale":"zh"},"3991":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#创建并打开-collection","content":"<Card icon=\"<Settings className=&#x22;text-fd-primary&#x22; />\" title=\"Collection 选项\" href=\"./options/\" />","locale":"zh"},"3992":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#实战示例-商品搜索","content":"如下 schema 建模了一个**多模态商品搜索系统**，结合视觉、文本和结构化元数据实现丰富的检索功能：","locale":"zh"},"3993":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`category` (字符串数组，启用索引)：支持类似 `category CONTAIN_ANY (\"electronics\", \"headphones\")` 的查询，用于查找属于“电子产品”或“耳机” (或两者皆是) 的商品。","locale":"zh"},"3994":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`price` (整数，启用索引并带有范围优化)：支持快速范围查询，如 `price > 100`。","locale":"zh"},"3995":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`in_stock`(布尔值，启用索引)：支持按库存状态过滤 (例如“仅显示有货商品”)。","locale":"zh"},"3996":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#️-标量字段用于过滤和展示","content":"`image_url` 和 `description` 仅存储但**不启用索引**，因为它们仅用于展示。","locale":"zh"},"3997":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"两个稠密向量捕获语义信息：","locale":"zh"},"3998":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"`image_vec`：用商品图片生成的512维向量 (如来自视觉模型)。","locale":"zh"},"3999":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"`description_vec`：用商品文字描述生成的768维向量 (如来自语言嵌入模型)，启用量化存储。","locale":"zh"},"4000":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create#-向量用于语义相关性检索","content":"一个稀疏向量 `keywords_sparse` 用于关键词匹配，支持混合稀疏-稠密检索。","locale":"zh"},"4001":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","type":"page","content":"选项","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection","创建"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","locale":"zh"},"4002":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`CollectionOption` 让用户在创建或打开一个 collection 时，对它的运行时行为进行精确控制：","locale":"zh"},"4003":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`read_only`：以只读模式打开 collection。在此模式下，任何尝试写入数据的操作均会触发错误异常。","locale":"zh"},"4004":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"**注意**：使用 `create_and_open()` 时，`read_only` 必须设为 `False`。这是因为 collection 的创建过程需要创建并写入文件。","locale":"zh"},"4005":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/options","content":"`enable_mmap`：启用内存映射 I/O 以实现更高效的数据访问 (默认为 `True`)。该机制通过略微增加内存缓存的占用，来换取显著的性能提升。","locale":"zh"},"4006":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"page","content":"Schema","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection","创建"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","locale":"zh"},"4007":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#collection-名称-step","content":"Collection 名称","locale":"zh"},"4008":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"标量字段","locale":"zh"},"4009":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"向量（Embedding）","locale":"zh"},"4010":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"选择向量索引类型","locale":"zh"},"4011":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#完整-schema-示例","content":"完整 Schema 示例","locale":"zh"},"4012":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"**Collection Schema** `CollectionSchema` 定义了插入到 collection 中的每个 document 必须遵循的结构。","locale":"zh"},"4013":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"Zvec 的 schema 是**动态的**：你可以随时添加或删除标量和向量字段，而无需重建 collection。","locale":"zh"},"4014":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`CollectionSchema` 包含三个部分：","locale":"zh"},"4015":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`name`：collection 的标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4016":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`fields`：标量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4017":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","content":"`vectors`：向量字段列表。","locale":"zh"},"4018":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#collection-名称-step","content":"Collection 标识符。此名称用于内部引用和日志记录。","locale":"zh"},"4019":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"标量字段存储非向量（即结构化）数据，如字符串、数字、布尔值或数组。","locale":"zh"},"4020":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"每个字段通过 `FieldSchema` 定义，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4021":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`name`：字段在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4022":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`data_type`：存储的数据类型 — 如 `STRING`、`INT64` 或数组类型 `ARRAY_STRING`。","locale":"zh"},"4023":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`nullable` (可选)：是否允许该字段为**空值** (默认为 `False`)。","locale":"zh"},"4024":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`index_param` (可选)：通过 `InvertIndexParam` 创建倒排索引实现快速过滤，或通过 `FtsIndexParam` 创建全文索引实现全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4025":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"请为需要检索的标量字段添加索引。未索引的字段能节省存储和写入开销。","locale":"zh"},"4026":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**倒排索引** (`InvertIndexParam`)，还可以选择性地开启一些能提升性能 (但会增加存储成本) 的功能：","locale":"zh"},"4027":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_range_optimization=True` → 加速范围查询 (如 `price > 100`)","locale":"zh"},"4028":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"`enable_extended_wildcard=True` → 支持复杂的字符串模式匹配 (如 `name LIKE 'abc%def'`)","locale":"zh"},"4029":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#标量字段-step","content":"对于**全文索引** (`FtsIndexParam`)，需要配置分词器和 Token 过滤器。详见全文检索。","locale":"zh"},"4030":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"使用 `VectorSchema` 定义向量字段，包含以下属性：","locale":"zh"},"4031":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`name`：向量在 collection 中的唯一字符串标识符。","locale":"zh"},"4032":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`data_type`：向量的数值格式。","locale":"zh"},"4033":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稠密向量：`VECTOR_FP32`、`VECTOR_FP16` 等。","locale":"zh"},"4034":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"稀疏向量：`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP32`、`SPARSE_VECTOR_FP16`。","locale":"zh"},"4035":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`dimension`：向量维度 (稠密向量必填项)。","locale":"zh"},"4036":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#向量embeddingstep","content":"`index_param`：用于配置向量索引的类型及相似度度量标准。","locale":"zh"},"4037":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`index_param` 让你能够灵活配置合适的索引策略：","locale":"zh"},"4038":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`metric_type`：`COSINE`、`L2` 或 `IP`(内积) — &#x2A;请务必确保你选择的度量方式与 embedding 模型训练方式保持一致!*","locale":"zh"},"4039":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`quantize_type` (可选)：对向量进行压缩，以减小索引体积并加速检索 (会有轻微的 recall 损失)。","locale":"zh"},"4040":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"`quantizer_param` (可选)：量化器的附加参数，例如 `enable_rotate` （通过随机旋转减小量化recall损失）。","locale":"zh"},"4041":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `FlatIndexParam()` 配置 Flat 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4042":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `HnswIndexParam()` 配置 HNSW 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4043":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `HnswRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 HNSW-RaBitQ 索引。该索引结合了 HNSW 图导航和 RaBitQ 量化，可降低内存使用。","locale":"zh"},"4044":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 仅在支持 AVX2 或 AVX512 的 **Linux x86\\_64** 平台上可用。Zvec 会自动选择最佳运行时。","locale":"zh"},"4045":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IVFIndexParam()` 配置 IVF 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4046":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `IvfRabitqIndexParam()` 配置 IVF-RaBitQ 索引。该索引使用 IVF 缩小扫描范围，并使用 RaBitQ 压缩列表内的向量。","locale":"zh"},"4047":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"IVF-RaBitQ 仅在支持 AVX2 或 AVX512 的 **Linux x86\\_64** 平台上可用。Zvec 会自动选择最佳运行时。","locale":"zh"},"4048":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/create/schema#选择向量索引类型","content":"使用 `DiskAnnIndexParam()` 配置 DiskANN 索引。","locale":"zh"},"4049":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"page","content":"DiskANN 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","locale":"zh"},"4050":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"面向十亿级近似最近邻搜索的磁盘图索引，以较低 QPS 为代价，在大幅降低内存占用的同时保持较高 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4051":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4052":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"何时使用 DiskANN 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4053":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4054":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4055":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4056":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4057":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4058":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"一种基于磁盘的图索引，专为**十亿级**向量搜索设计 — 将压缩向量保存在内存中，全精度向量存储在磁盘上，实现高 Recall 的近似最近邻搜索，同时**大幅降低内存占用**。","locale":"zh"},"4059":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"DiskANN 由 Subramanya 等人在 NeurIPS 2019 论文 DiskANN: Fast Accurate Billion-point Nearest Neighbor Search on a Single Node 中提出。","locale":"zh"},"4060":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**平台支持**：DiskANN 目前**仅支持 Linux** 平台。","locale":"zh"},"4061":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"**`libaio` 为可选依赖。** 如果系统已安装 `libaio`，DiskANN 会使用 Linux 异步 I/O 以获得更好的性能；如果未安装，DiskANN 仍可通过备用 I/O 路径正常运行，但查询性能可能略低。","locale":"zh"},"4062":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","content":"不过，由于查询路径涉及磁盘 I/O，DiskANN 的 **QPS 低于纯内存索引**（如 HNSW），因此更适合对吞吐和延迟不敏感、但需要在受限内存下处理超大规模数据的场景。","locale":"zh"},"4063":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"DiskANN 在完整数据集上构建 Vamana 图，并将其与原始向量一起存储在磁盘上。搜索时，仅 PQ（乘积量化）压缩编码驻留在内存中，图和全精度向量按需从磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4064":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**Vamana 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4065":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"单层图结构，每个节点最多连接 `max_degree` 个邻居。","locale":"zh"},"4066":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"图的构建采用贪心搜索-剪枝策略，通过 **alpha 参数**鼓励长距离边，实现快速收敛到查询点的邻域。","locale":"zh"},"4067":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**中心点**（medoid，距数据集质心最近的点）作为每次搜索的固定入口。","locale":"zh"},"4068":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**乘积量化（PQ）用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4069":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"向量空间被划分为 `pq_chunk_num` 个子空间，每个子向量被量化为 256 个质心的码本（8-bit PQ 编码）。","locale":"zh"},"4070":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"查询时，预先计算查询向量的 **PQ 距离查找表**，通过快速表查找而非全精度运算来计算候选点的近似距离。","locale":"zh"},"4071":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"**带缓存的束搜索** 🔎","locale":"zh"},"4072":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"搜索从中心点开始，使用**束搜索**（beam search）策略探索图 — 多个前沿节点通过批量磁盘 I/O 并发扩展。","locale":"zh"},"4073":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"入口点附近的高频访问节点被缓存在内存中（**BFS 层级缓存**），减少热点区域的磁盘读取。","locale":"zh"},"4074":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#工作原理","content":"对于每个访问的节点，使用 PQ 编码计算近似距离，并从磁盘读取全精度向量为 top-k 候选结果计算精确距离。","locale":"zh"},"4075":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ **无法完全装入内存**的十亿级数据集","locale":"zh"},"4076":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 对成本敏感、需要最小化内存消耗的部署场景","locale":"zh"},"4077":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"✅ 可以容忍相比内存索引稍高延迟的批处理工作负载和离线分析","locale":"zh"},"4078":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#何时使用-diskann-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：当数据集远超可用内存时使用 DiskANN。它以仅与 PQ 编码成比例的内存消耗提供出色的 Recall。如果数据集可以装入内存，建议使用 HNSW 或 HNSW-RaBitQ 以获得更低延迟。","locale":"zh"},"4079":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **极低的内存占用** — 仅 PQ 压缩编码（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）驻留内存，使十亿级搜索在普通硬件上成为可能","locale":"zh"},"4080":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **高 Recall** — Vamana 图通过基于 alpha 的剪枝保持连通性和多样性，最终候选结果重新计算精确距离","locale":"zh"},"4081":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#优势","content":"✨ **可扩展的图构建** — 采用简单的贪心插入-剪枝算法，可跨线程并行化","locale":"zh"},"4082":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢","locale":"zh"},"4083":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4084":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景","locale":"zh"},"4085":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始。先调整查询时的 `list_size` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要更好 Recall 时增加 `max_degree` — 但预期会增加磁盘占用和构建时间。如果需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall，可减少 `pq_chunk_num`。","locale":"zh"},"4086":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4087":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4088":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4089":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4090":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4091":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4092":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`max_degree`","locale":"zh"},"4093":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — Vamana 图中每个节点的最大边数","locale":"zh"},"4094":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `max_degree` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多磁盘占用和更长的构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4095":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4096":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建时候选列表大小** — 插入新向量时图构建过程中考虑的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4097":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4098":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"`pq_chunk_num`","locale":"zh"},"4099":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"**PQ 子空间数量** — 控制向量维度如何划分以进行乘积量化","locale":"zh"},"4100":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多 chunk →  ✨ 更精细的距离近似和更好的 Recall  ⚠️ PQ 编码占用更多内存（每向量每 chunk 1 字节）","locale":"zh"},"4101":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4102":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4103":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4104":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"`list_size`","locale":"zh"},"4105":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时候选列表大小** — 束搜索图遍历时维护的候选数量","locale":"zh"},"4106":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/diskann-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `list_size` →  ✨ 更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更多磁盘 I/O 和更高的查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4107":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"page","content":"Flat 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","locale":"zh"},"4108":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","content":"相似性检索的基线","locale":"zh"},"4109":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4110":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"何时使用 Flat 索引","locale":"zh"},"4111":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4112":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"局限","locale":"zh"},"4113":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#工作原理","content":"通过将查询向量与数据集中的所有向量逐一比对，实现精确相似性检索 (暴力检索)。","locale":"zh"},"4114":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 小规模数据集","locale":"zh"},"4115":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 原型设计与实验阶段","locale":"zh"},"4116":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 作为评估基准","locale":"zh"},"4117":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"✅ 对召回率要求 100% 且不可妥协的场景","locale":"zh"},"4118":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#何时使用-flat-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：在开发和测试阶段，建议先使用 Flat 索引 — 把它当作你的正确性基准。一旦方案验证通过，再考虑使用近似索引 (如 HNSW) 来获得生产级别的性能。对于数据量极小 (比如30万条向量的规模) 且正确性优于速度的场景，Flat Index 也是一个完全可行的选择。","locale":"zh"},"4119":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **完美 Recall 保证** — 能找到真正的最近邻","locale":"zh"},"4120":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **零配置** — 简单设置，无需调参","locale":"zh"},"4121":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#优势","content":"✨ **即时索引** — 构建时间几乎为零","locale":"zh"},"4122":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/flat-index#局限","content":"⚠️ 搜索延迟随数据量大小呈线性增长 —  这意味着它难以支撑大规模的工作负载。","locale":"zh"},"4123":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","locale":"zh"},"4124":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","content":"一种基于图结构的索引，也是实现低延迟相似度检索的首选方案 — 它以较高的内存占用为代价，提供了业界顶尖的检索速度和召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4125":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4126":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"何时使用 HNSW 索引？","locale":"zh"},"4127":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4128":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4129":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4130":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4131":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4132":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW 构建了一个**多层图结构**，其中每个节点代表一个向量，节点间的边则根据相似度建立连接。","locale":"zh"},"4133":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"层级化的多层布局 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4134":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**上层**：结构稀疏且节点较少，充当“高速公路”，用于实现快速的长距离导航。","locale":"zh"},"4135":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**下层**：结构稠密且包含更多节点，提供细粒度的局部邻域连接。","locale":"zh"},"4136":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"搜索过程（从粗粒度到细粒度）🔍","locale":"zh"},"4137":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"从顶层的**入口节点**开始。","locale":"zh"},"4138":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在当前层，以贪心策略走向距离查询向量更近的邻居节点，直到无法再接近为止。","locale":"zh"},"4139":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"然后在该位置**下降一层**，并重复同样的贪心搜索的过程。","locale":"zh"},"4140":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"在**最底层**，以更精细的搜索策略执行该过程 (使用候选集列表)，以得到更准确的结果。","locale":"zh"},"4141":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**为什么 HNSW 既快又准** ⚡ 🎯","locale":"zh"},"4142":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**快**：上层结构可以快速跳转到目标区域，无需遍历绝大多数节点。","locale":"zh"},"4143":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#工作原理","content":"**准**：底层结构稠密，能对局部邻域进行精细化搜索，从而保证高召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4144":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 实时、低延迟应用 (如对话式 AI 和实时推荐系统)","locale":"zh"},"4145":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"✅ 需要在极低延迟下保持高召回率的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4146":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#何时使用-hnsw-索引","content":"**最佳实践**：HNSW 是我们针对大多数生产环境**推荐的首选方案**。它在速度、准确性和稳定性之间取得了极佳的平衡。","locale":"zh"},"4147":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ **近似于对数级的查询时间** — 对于大型数据集，通常能达到 &#x2A;*O(log n)** 的效率","locale":"zh"},"4148":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 具备极强的适应性，在多种数据分布下**均能维持高召回率**","locale":"zh"},"4149":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#优势","content":"✨ 索引**构建速度比许多替代方案都要快** (如基于 IVF 的方法)","locale":"zh"},"4150":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)","locale":"zh"},"4151":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)","locale":"zh"},"4152":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：先从默认值开始，然后优先调整 `ef` 来平衡召回率和延迟。只有在必要时，才增加 `ef_construction` 或 `m` 来提升精度 — 这会降低索引构建的速度并增加内存使用。","locale":"zh"},"4153":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4154":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4155":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4156":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4157":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的**相似度度量**","locale":"zh"},"4158":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4159":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4160":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 构建图过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向连接数量","locale":"zh"},"4161":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 召回率更高，图连通性更好  ⚠️ 内存占用更多，索引和检索的延迟都会增加","locale":"zh"},"4162":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4163":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"**构建索引时的候选池大小** — 决定了算法在插入新向量时会考察多少个邻居候选项","locale":"zh"},"4164":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 图的质量更好，召回率更高  ⚠️ 索引构建时间更长 (*不影响查询速度*)","locale":"zh"},"4165":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"`quantize_type`","locale":"zh"},"4166":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"向量**量化**方式  默认不开启量化","locale":"zh"},"4167":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引构建参数","content":"详见量化","locale":"zh"},"4168":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4169":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4170":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4171":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`ef`","locale":"zh"},"4172":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时的候选池大小** — 决定了在图遍历过程中每一步会探索多少个潜在邻居","locale":"zh"},"4173":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef` →  ✨ 召回率更高  ⚠️  查询延迟也会增加  💡 如果发现 `ef=300` 时搜不到想要的结果，不妨试着调到 `500` 或甚至更高，以此来扩大搜索范围。","locale":"zh"},"4174":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`radius`","locale":"zh"},"4175":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"**距离(相似度)阈值**，用于范围过滤 — 只有满足该阈值的 documents 才会被返回","locale":"zh"},"4176":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"示例： • 使用内积 `MetricType.IP` 时，设置 `radius=0.6` 仅保留分数 > 0.6 的结果  ✅ 适用于：想要剔除掉低质量匹配的结果  🚫 不适用于：必须返回全部 top-K 个结果，不关心分数质量","locale":"zh"},"4177":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_linear`","locale":"zh"},"4178":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"强制使用**暴力线性检索** (不使用配置的索引)","locale":"zh"},"4179":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"🐌 大数据集下非常慢！ ✅ 仅用于：调试、超小数据集或验证索引准确性","locale":"zh"},"4180":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"`is_using_refiner`","locale":"zh"},"4181":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"对头部候选结果**启用精排** (重新计算精确的相似度分数) — 在开启了**量化**的场景下有帮助，能挽回精度损失，提高召回质量","locale":"zh"},"4182":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-index#索引查询参数","content":"✅ 在启用量化的场景下，如需得到更高精度时开启精排  ⚠️ 注意：因为要重新精确计算分数，所以会增加查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4183":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"page","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 索引","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","locale":"zh"},"4184":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"HNSW + RaBitQ 量化","locale":"zh"},"4185":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh"},"4186":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"何时使用 HNSW-RaBitQ？","locale":"zh"},"4187":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"优势","locale":"zh"},"4188":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"权衡","locale":"zh"},"4189":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"关键参数","locale":"zh"},"4190":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"索引构建参数","locale":"zh"},"4191":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"索引查询参数","locale":"zh"},"4192":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"一种先进的基于图的索引，将 HNSW 图结构与 RaBitQ 量化算法相结合 — 在保持一流搜索质量的同时**大幅降低内存使用**。","locale":"zh"},"4193":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","content":"**平台要求**：HNSW-RaBitQ 目前仅支持 **Linux x86\\_64**，CPU 需要支持 **AVX2 或 AVX512**。Zvec 会自动选择最佳运行时。","locale":"zh"},"4194":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"HNSW-RaBitQ 结合两项技术实现高 Recall 和低内存占用：","locale":"zh"},"4195":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**HNSW 图用于导航** 🪜","locale":"zh"},"4196":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"与标准 HNSW 索引相同的多层图结构 — 上层稀疏用于快速远距离跳转，下层密集用于细粒度局部搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4197":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"**RaBitQ 用于距离估计** 🔍","locale":"zh"},"4198":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#工作原理","content":"RaBitQ 先对向量进行**随机旋转**，然后将其转换为**二进制编码**（0 和 1）。这种方法允许系统通过高效的位运算来估计距离，与处理全精度数值相比，显著**降低了内存使用和计算成本**。","locale":"zh"},"4199":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 需要快速搜索、高 Recall 且内存预算可控的生产系统","locale":"zh"},"4200":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 超大规模高维数据集 — 十亿级 1536+ 维向量在 FP32 格式下会消耗 TB 级内存","locale":"zh"},"4201":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"✅ 运行在支持 AVX2 或 AVX512 的 **Linux x86\\_64** 服务器上的工作负载","locale":"zh"},"4202":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"**最佳实践**：当你希望获得 HNSW 级别的搜索质量而无需承担高内存开销时，使用 HNSW-RaBitQ。","locale":"zh"},"4203":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#何时使用-hnsw-rabitq","content":"`total_bits` 参数控制精度-内存的权衡。根据论文，在特定数据集上，**7 位**可达约 99% Recall，**5 位**约 95%，**4 位**约 90%。最低可使用 **1 位**以最大化压缩，但会降低 Recall。","locale":"zh"},"4204":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **大幅降低内存** — 量化后的向量最多比 FP32 小 32 倍，减少活跃索引大小","locale":"zh"},"4205":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **高效距离估计** — RaBitQ 支持基于位运算的高效相似度计算","locale":"zh"},"4206":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#优势","content":"✨ **无需重排序即可获得出色 Recall** — 图构建使用原始向量，保持图质量；RaBitQ 提供渐近最优的误差界，确保排序可靠","locale":"zh"},"4207":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **平台受限** — 仅支持 Linux x86\\_64，需要 AVX2 或 AVX512","locale":"zh"},"4208":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间","locale":"zh"},"4209":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#权衡","content":"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量","locale":"zh"},"4210":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#关键参数","content":"**调参建议**：\n从默认值开始（`total_bits=7`，`num_clusters=16`）。先调整查询时的 `ef` 来权衡 Recall 和延迟。仅在需要进一步降低内存且可接受稍低 Recall 时减小 `total_bits`。","locale":"zh"},"4211":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4212":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4213":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4214":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`metric_type`","locale":"zh"},"4215":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"用于比较向量的相似度度量","locale":"zh"},"4216":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"根据 Embedding 模型的训练方式选择","locale":"zh"},"4217":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`m`","locale":"zh"},"4218":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**每个节点的最大邻居数** — 图构建过程中为每个节点创建的最大双向链接数","locale":"zh"},"4219":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `m` →  ✨ 更好的 Recall 和图连通性  ⚠️ 更多内存使用，索引和搜索延迟更高","locale":"zh"},"4220":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`ef_construction`","locale":"zh"},"4221":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**索引时候选池大小** — 插入新向量时算法考虑的候选邻居数","locale":"zh"},"4222":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef_construction` →  ✨ 更好的图质量和更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更长的索引构建时间（*不影响查询速度*）","locale":"zh"},"4223":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`total_bits`","locale":"zh"},"4224":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**RaBitQ 每维量化位数** — 控制二进制编码精度","locale":"zh"},"4225":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"控制精度-内存权衡。 更低的值节省更多内存但降低精度","locale":"zh"},"4226":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`num_clusters`","locale":"zh"},"4227":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**KMeans 聚类数** — 在 RaBitQ 训练阶段用于划分向量空间","locale":"zh"},"4228":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"• 更多聚类可捕获更精细的分布模式  • 更高的值可略微提升 Recall","locale":"zh"},"4229":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"`sample_count`","locale":"zh"},"4230":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"**训练样本数** — KMeans 训练采样的向量数量（`0` = 使用全部向量）","locale":"zh"},"4231":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认为 `0`。在超大数据集上设置较小的值（如 5,000,000）可加速训练并减少内存使用","locale":"zh"},"4232":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4233":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4234":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/d