tq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"需要更高精度时启用，但会增加候选读取和精确距离计算开销","locale":"zh"},"4405":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`scale_factor`","locale":"zh"},"4406":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`10.0`","locale":"zh"},"4407":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"启用 Refiner 时的候选扩展倍数","locale":"zh"},"4408":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"更大的值为精化阶段提供更多候选，通常有利于 Recall，但会增加延迟；仅在 `is_using_refiner=True` 时生效","locale":"zh"},"4409":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/ivf-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"Node.js 中 `nprobe` 和 `radius` 名称不变，其余参数使用 `isLinear`、`isUsingRefiner` 和 `scaleFactor`。","locale":"zh"},"4410":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"page","content":"量化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","入门","概念","向量索引"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","locale":"zh"},"4411":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"存储行为","locale":"zh"},"4412":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"启用量化","locale":"zh"},"4413":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#量化类型","content":"量化类型","locale":"zh"},"4414":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#fp16-半精度浮点","content":"FP16 (半精度浮点)","locale":"zh"},"4415":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int8-8位整数量化","content":"INT8 (8位整数量化)","locale":"zh"},"4416":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int4-4位整数量化","content":"INT4 (4位整数量化)","locale":"zh"},"4417":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用旋转","content":"启用旋转","locale":"zh"},"4418":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种压缩技术，&#x2A;**它将向量从原始格式 (如 FP32) 转换为更紧凑的表示形式***，从而减小用于搜检索的向量索引的大小。","locale":"zh"},"4419":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"这种转换通过减少每个维度所用的比特数，来近似原始向量，从而实现：","locale":"zh"},"4420":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更低的**内存占用** — 尤其当索引常驻内存时；","locale":"zh"},"4421":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 更快的 I/O 速度和更低的查询延迟 — 减少了数据传输开销，还充分利用了高效的整数或半精度浮点 (FP16) 计算；","locale":"zh"},"4422":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"✨ 在资源受限的硬件上实现更好的可扩展性。","locale":"zh"},"4423":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"**重要**：","locale":"zh"},"4424":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化是一种**有损且不可逆**的压缩方法。它以**可能降低召回率为代价**，换取更高的运行时效率。请务必验证其对检索质量的影响。","locale":"zh"},"4425":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","content":"量化仅在应用于 **FP32** 格式的向量时才能带来收益。","locale":"zh"},"4426":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"为确保数据完整性和灵活性，**Zvec 同时存储原始向量及其量化版本**。这意味着：","locale":"zh"},"4427":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"**磁盘上的总存储占用可能会增加** (因为保存了两份副本)。","locale":"zh"},"4428":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"构建索引和检索时**只需加载量化后的向量**，大幅减少内存占用。","locale":"zh"},"4429":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#存储行为","content":"用户随时都能按需取回**原始的完整向量**。","locale":"zh"},"4430":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"你可以在创建向量索引时，**通过在 `VectorSchema` 中设置 `quantize_type` 参数** (例如 `FP16`、`INT8` 或 `INT4`) 来开启量化功能。","locale":"zh"},"4431":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用量化","content":"配置完成后，Zvec 会自动在原始向量的基础上，生成并管理对应的量化版本。","locale":"zh"},"4432":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#fp16-半精度浮点","content":"使用16位浮点数来表示向量，在大幅减少内存占用并加快计算速度的同时，依然能保持极高的数值精度。非常适合那些需要接近 FP32 精度，但又希望提升运行效率的应用场景。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4433":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int8-8位整数量化","content":"使用8位整数来表示向量，显著降低了存储需求和内存带宽压力。对于许多相似度检索任务，提供了速度、大小和检索精度之间的良好平衡。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4434":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#int4-4位整数量化","content":"一种极致紧凑的表示方式，每个维度仅需4位。它能最大化存储密度并提升推理速度，非常适合对延迟极其敏感或硬件资源受限的环境 (前提是你能接受较多的精度损失)。(需由 FP32 源数据转换而来)","locale":"zh"},"4435":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/quantization#启用旋转","content":"在启用 `INT8` 或 `INT4` 量化时，你可以通过在 `VectorSchema` 中设置 `quantizer_param` 参数，**指定 `enable_rotate=True` 来开启旋转**。该功能会在量化前对向量施加一次随机正交旋转，使各维度的分布更加均匀，从而减小量化过程中的信息损失，提高量化后索引的召回率。","locale":"zh"},"4436":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"page","content":"条件过滤","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","数据操作","查询"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","locale":"zh"},"4437":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#性能注意事项","content":"性能注意事项","locale":"zh"},"4438":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#前提条件","content":"前提条件","locale":"zh"},"4439":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#执行条件过滤","content":"执行条件过滤","locale":"zh"},"4440":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#支持的过滤语法","content":"支持的过滤语法","locale":"zh"},"4441":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#比较运算符","content":"比较运算符","locale":"zh"},"4442":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#成员运算符","content":"成员运算符","locale":"zh"},"4443":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#字符串运算符","content":"字符串运算符","locale":"zh"},"4444":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#逻辑运算符","content":"逻辑运算符","locale":"zh"},"4445":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","content":"条件过滤允许你根据标量字段的特定条件检索 Document — 类似于 SQL 中的 `WHERE` 子句。","locale":"zh"},"4446":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#性能注意事项","content":"**已索引的标量字段**：可以被高效搜索。","locale":"zh"},"4447":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#性能注意事项","content":"**未索引的标量字段**：仍然可以搜索，但性能会显著降低。","locale":"zh"},"4448":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/query/filter#性能注意事项","content":"为了获得最佳性能，请确保**常用的过滤字段已建立索引**。\\\n更多详情请参阅倒排索引。","locale":"zh"},"4449":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/data-operations/que