pecific hardware or environments."],[3294,"⚙️ **定制**：针对特定硬件或环境进行编译定制。"],[1590,"⚠️ **Build-time PQ training** — Requires a KMeans-based PQ training step before index construction, adding to the total build time"],[1869,"⚠️ **Data constraints** — Supports FP32 dense vectors with 64–4095 dimensions and the `L2`, `IP`, and `COSINE` metrics"],[1716,"⚠️ **Dimension constraints** — Only supports vectors between 64 and 4095 dimensions"],[1867,"⚠️ **Higher construction cost** — Requires centroid training, random rotation, and quantized-code generation"],[1657,"⚠️ **Higher memory footprint** — Graph links require additional storage (scales with `m`)"],[1589,"⚠️ **Higher query latency** — Each search requires disk I/O for graph traversal, making it slower than pure in-memory indexes like HNSW"],[1807,"⚠️ **Indexing Overhead** — Building the index requires clustering, which can be computationally intensive and slower to build than indexes like HNSW"],[1591,"⚠️ **Not suited for real-time workloads** — Disk access latency means DiskANN is better for latency-tolerant use cases or scenarios with relatively low QPS requirements"],[1763,"⚠️ **Painfully slow at scale**: With millions or billions of vectors, queries can take seconds or minutes, making them impractical for real-time applications."],[1868,"⚠️ **Parameter sensitivity** — `nlist` and `nprobe` must be evaluated against the dataset size, distribution, recall target, and latency budget"],[1808,"⚠️ **Parameter Sensitivity** — Accuracy and latency are highly dependent on the choice of `n_list` and `n_probe`"],[1714,"⚠️ **Platform constraints** — Supports Linux x86\\_64 only and requires AVX2 or AVX512"],[1866,"⚠️ **Platform constraints** — Supports Linux x86\\_64 only and requires AVX2 or AVX512"],[1268,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The index requires additional storage space."],[1168,"⚠️ **Storage overhead**: The inverted map, term frequencies, and position data require additional storage."],[1170,"⚠️ **Tokenizer dependency**: Retrieval quality depends on tokenizer choice — for example, Chinese text requires the Jieba tokenizer rather than the default standard tokenizer."],[921,"⚠️ **Trade-off**"],[1715,"⚠️ **Training overhead** — Requires a KMeans training step before index construction, adding to build time"],[1269,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation — `INSERT`, `UPSERT`, and `UPDATE` — require index maintenance, which adds latency to writes and increases I/O load."],[1169,"⚠️ **Write amplification**: Every write operation requires tokenization and index updates, adding write latency."],[4084,"⚠️ **不适合实时工作负载** — 磁盘访问延迟意味着 DiskANN 更适合面向可容忍延迟或 QPS 要求相对低的场景"],[4150,"⚠️ **内存占用较高** — 图结构的连接关系需要额外的存储空间 (随 `m` 增长)"],[3762,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作 — `INSERT`、`UPSERT` 和 `UPDATE` — 都需要维护索引，增加了写入延迟和 I/O 负载。"],[3662,"⚠️ **写放大**：每次写操作都需要分词并更新倒排索引，增加写入延迟。"],[3663,"⚠️ **分词器依赖**：检索效果与分词质量直接相关 — 中文文本需要使用 Jieba 分词器而非 Standard 分词器。"],[4362,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — `nlist` 和 `nprobe` 需要根据数据规模、分布、Recall 目标及延迟预算进行验证"],[4302,"⚠️ **参数敏感** — 检索的召回率和延迟高度依赖于 `n_list` 和 `n_probe` 的选择"],[3412,"⚠️ **取舍**"],[4256,"⚠️ **大规模下性能极低**：当面对数百万乃至数十亿的向量数据时，查询耗时可能长达数秒甚至数分钟，导致其无法满足实时应用的需求。"],[3661,"⚠️ **存储开销**：倒排映射、词频统计和位置信息需要额外存储空间。"],[3761,"⚠️ **存储开销**：索引需要额外的存储空间。"],[4207,"⚠️ **平台受限** — 仅支持 Linux x86\\_64，需要 AVX2 或 AVX512"],[4360,"⚠️ **平台受限** — 仅支持 Linux x86\\_64，需要 AVX2 或 AVX512"],[4363,"⚠️ **数据限制** — 仅支持 FP32 稠密向量、64–4095 维，以及 `L2`、`IP`、`COSINE` 距离度量"],[4361,"⚠️ **构建开销较大** — 需要训练质心、执行随机旋转并生成量化编码"],[4083,"⚠️ **构建时 PQ 训练开销** — 索引构建前需要基于 KMeans 的 PQ 训练步骤，增加总构建时间"],[4301,"⚠️ **索引构建开销大** — 建立索引需要经过聚类计算，计算密集度较高，构建速度通常比 HNSW 等索引更慢"],[4209,"⚠️ **维度限制** — 仅支持 64 到 4095 维之间的向量"],[4208,"⚠️ **训练开销** — 索引构建前需要 KMeans 训练步骤，增加构建时间"],[4082,"⚠️ **较高的查询延迟** — 每次搜索需要磁盘 I/O 进行图遍历，比纯内存索引（如 HNSW）慢"],[1658,"⚠️ &#x2A;*Indexing complexity of O(n log n)** — Slower build time than Flat index (but often faster than IVF)"],[4151,"⚠️ &#x2A;*索引构建时间复杂度为 O(n log n)** — 构建时间比 Flat 索引慢 (但通常比 IVF 快)"],[1629,"⚠️ Search latency grows linearly with dataset size — ma