ument IDs, alignment, and other metadata"],[1587,"✨ **High recall** — The Vamana graph preserves connectivity and diversity through its alpha-based pruning, and exact distances are recomputed for final candidates"],[1628,"✨ **Instant Indexing** — Build time is virtually immediate"],[1806,"✨ **Memory Efficiency** — Stores vectors in compact inverted lists with minimal overhead from centroids and list pointers, typically uses significantly less memory than graph-based methods like HNSW"],[1654,"✨ **Near-logarithmic query time** — Typically &#x2A;*O(log n)** for large datasets"],[1626,"✨ **Perfect Recall Guarantee** — Finds true nearest neighbors"],[1713,"✨ **Promising Recall Without Re-ranking** — Graph construction uses original vectors, preserving graph quality and RaBitQ provides an asymptotically optimal error bound for reliable ordering and reranking."],[1863,"✨ **Reduces query work in two stages** — IVF scans only selected inverted lists, while RaBitQ uses compact codes and bitwise operations to accelerate distance estimation within each list"],[1805,"✨ **Scalability** — Query time scales approximately as &#x2A;*O(N / `n_list` × `n_probe`)**, making it highly efficient for large `N` when `n_list` is large and `n_probe` is small"],[1588,"✨ **Scalable graph construction** — Built with a simple greedy insert-and-prune algorithm that can be parallelized across threads"],[1627,"✨ **Zero Configuration** — Simple setup with no tuning required"],[4298,"✨ **兼容性** — 常作为复合索引 (例如 IVF-PQ) 的基础层，用于进一步的优化"],[4358,"✨ **内存效率高** — `total_bits=1` 时，单看量化向量载荷，理论上可缩小到 FP32 的约 1/32；实际索引还包含质心、文档 ID、对齐及其他元数据"],[4300,"✨ **内存高效** — 向量被存储在紧凑的倒排列表中，质心和列表指针带来的额外开销极小。与 HNSW 等基于图的索引方法相比，通常能显著节省内存"],[4121,"✨ **即时索引** — 构建时间几乎为零"],[4357,"✨ **双重缩减查询开销** — IVF 只扫描部分倒排列表，RaBitQ 再通过紧凑编码和位运算加速列表内距离估计"],[4081,"✨ **可扩展的图构建** — 采用简单的贪心插入-剪枝算法，可跨线程并行化"],[4204,"✨ **大幅降低内存** — 量化后的向量最多比 FP32 小 32 倍，减少活跃索引大小"],[4119,"✨ **完美 Recall 保证** — 能找到真正的最近邻"],[4359,"✨ **支持误差界剪枝** — 先使用低成本估算和下界过滤候选，仅对有机会进入 Top-K 的候选执行更